{
  "summary": "A unimodal RNA-only model using pca_n2000 encoder achieved 48.49% validation accuracy and 46.39% F1, lower than the previous multimodal configuration's 52.66% accuracy. This suggests the multimodal approach may provide performance benefits, but the absence of direct comparisons to other unimodal baselines leaves uncertainty about the role of encoder choices and fusion strategies. The impact of image modality remains unclear without additional experimental controls."
}

